  "reasoning": "The defendant used violence to beat the victim, causing a fracture and a level‑2 light injury, which constitutes intentional injury (故意伤害). He then forced the victim to consume methamphetamine, which is the crime of forcing another to use drugs (强迫吸毒). He compelled the victim to sign a 500,000‑yuan IOU under duress, amounting to extortion (敲诈勒索). By taking the victim to a hotel room and holding him there against his will, he illegally restricted the victim’s personal freedom, constituting illegal detention (非法拘禁).",
